# __PKG_NAME__

The `ant` binary for __TARGET_DESC__ (`__RUST_TARGET__`).

This package is an implementation detail of
[`@withautonomi/ant`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@withautonomi/ant), which declares it as an
optional dependency guarded by `os`/`cpu` so npm installs only the binary your machine needs.
Install the meta package instead:

```sh
npm install -g @withautonomi/ant
```

The binary is copied verbatim from the `ant-cli-v__VERSION__`
[release assets](https://github.com/WithAutonomi/ant-client/releases/tag/ant-cli-v__VERSION__)
after checksum and signature verification, so it is byte-identical to the published archive.

